  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "case-3641",
      "trackingNumber": "DSAEU/R/2026/60207",
      "title": "rti for asking where is college fund asked by dseu",
      "subjectCategory": "State University & Technical Campuses",
      "summary": "rti for asking where is college fund asked by dseu",
      "description": "To, The Public Information Officer (PIO), Delhi Skill and Entrepreneurship University (DSEU), Govt. of NCT of Delhi, Integrated Institute of Technology Complex, Sector 9, Dwarka, New Delhi - 110077.\n\nSubject: Application under Section 6(1) of the Right to Information Act, 2005.\n\nSir/Madam,\n\nI hereby request the following information under the Right to Information Act, 2005, regarding the utilization of student funds at DSEU:\n\n1. Provide certified copies of the audited Income and Expenditure statements and Balance Sheets for DSEU for the financial years 2022-23 and 2023-24.\n2. Provide an itemized statement detailing the utilization of 'Student Development Funds' and 'Laboratory/Library Fees' collected from students across all campuses for the academic year 2023-24.\n3. Provide certified copies of administrative sanction orders and procurement work orders exceeding Rs. 50,000/- issued against the student fund accounts during the period of April 2023 to March 2024.\n4. Provide the name and designation of the Drawing and Disbursing Officer (DDO) responsible for the management and oversight of student-related funds at the university level.\n\nI have attached the prescribed RTI fee of Rs. 10/- via [Insert Mode of Payment, e.g., IPO/Demand Draft/Online Receipt No.]. \n\nI request you to provide the information within the statutory period of 30 days as mandated under Section 7(1) of the RTI Act, 2005. If the requested information does not pertain to your office, I request you to transfer this application to the concerned PIO under Section 6(3) of the Act.\n\nApplicant Details:\nName: [Your Name]\nAddress: [Your Address]\nPhone: [Your Phone Number]\nDate: [Current Date]",
      "queries": [
        "Certified copies of official file notings and sanction order.",
        "Statement of funds allocated, disbursed, and unutilized balances.",
        "Inspection logs, compliance reports, and complaint registers.",
        "Designation of officers responsible for execution and delay resolution."
      ],
